<title>Special Tools, Fixtures and Equipment</title>
<topic><?Pub Dtl><title>Special Tools</title>
<prclist1>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
<unlist><unlitem><para>The recommended special tools, fixtures and
equipment for the Seat Assembly are given in <refint reftype="1"
refid="table-25">Table 25-15-65-994-001-A01.</refint></para></unlitem>
</unlist>
<note><para>You can use equivalent alternatives for items in the lists.</para>
</note>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
