<prcitem1><prcitem>
<para>A crank P/N 139010 (F067382) is located on lower structure fairing.
The crank handle can be used to adjust seat height manually <grphcref
refid="GRAPHIC-25-15-65-991-901-A01"></grphcref>.</para>
</prcitem><graphic chapnbr="25" sectnbr="15" subjnbr="65" func="991"
seq="901" confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="9001" chg="u"
key="GRAPHIC-25-15-65-991-901-A01" revdate="20250131"><title>Crank</title>
<sheet gnbr="graphic25-15-65-991-901-A01-01" sheetnbr="1" imgarea="bp"
chg="u" key="graphic25-15-65-991-901-A01-01" revdate="20250131"></sheet>
</graphic></prcitem1>
<?Pub _newpage>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
<para>The seat controls tools P/N D11-065 &amp; P/N D11-110 can be
used to install seat assembly to check locking/unlocking and longitudinal
movement <grphcref refid="graphic-25-15-65-991-902-a01"></grphcref>.</para>
