<pgblk chapnbr="25" sectnbr="15" subjnbr="65" pgblknbr="13001" chg="u"
key="PGBLK-25-15-65-13001-" revdate="20250131"><isempty></pgblk>
<pgblk chapnbr="25" sectnbr="15" subjnbr="65" pgblknbr="15001" chg="u"
key="PGBLK-25-15-65-15001-" revdate="20250131">
<title>STORAGE</title>
<task chapnbr="25" sectnbr="15" subjnbr="65" func="550" seq="801"
confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="15001" chg="u"
key="TASK-25-15-65-550-801-A01" revdate="20250131">
<title>Storage</title>
<topic><?Pub Dtl><title>Reason for the job</title>
<prclist1>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
<caution><para>DO NOT PUT THE SEAT LEGS ON CONCRETE GROUND OR ON STEEL
SURFACES with no CORROSION PROTECTION.</para>
</caution>
<caution><para>ALL THE CONSUMABLES SUPPLIED BY SAFRAN AND LISTED INTO
THE CMM CAN HAVE A LIMITED LIFETIME. PLEASE REVIEW LABELS ON CONTAINER
OR EXAMINE THE TECHNICAL DATA SHEET BEFORE USE OR STORE.</para>
</caution>
<para>The equipment is essentially corrosion resistant and special
preservation is not required.</para>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
</prclist1>
</topic><topic><?Pub Dtl><title>Job set-up information</title>
<note><para>You can use equivalent alternatives for items in the lists.</para>
</note>
<prclist1>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
<para>Tools, features and equipment</para>
</prcitem>
